sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant FE as Messaging UI
    participant REST as Messaging REST
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant EV as AFTER_COMMIT listener
    participant WS as STOMP user queue

    U->>FE: Send TEXT
    FE->>FE: Add optimistic item with UUID v4
    FE->>REST: POST /api/v1/conversations/{id}/messages
    REST->>DB: Pair lock, Block/Follow/idempotency checks
    alt Valid replay
        DB-->>REST: Existing message
        REST-->>FE: 200 replayed=true
    else New message
        REST->>DB: Insert message and update conversation
        REST->>DB: Commit
        REST-->>FE: 201 message
        DB-->>EV: MESSAGE_CREATED after commit
        EV->>DB: Requery visibility and unread per user
        EV->>WS: Send sender and recipient /queue/messaging
        WS-->>FE: Merge by messageId/clientMessageId
    end
